 "prepText": "AURON · 2 OF 3 “Your party is ready.” The tabs are for later. Start the battle. ESC SKIP THE GUIDE PARTY PREP EXP · THE FARPLANE CUP — THE FIEND ARENA — A STAND-IN STAGE Y Yuna LV 99 R Rikku LV 99 P Paine LV 99 CHAPTER DRESSPHERES STATS ACCESSORIES ITEMS FFX-2 · EXP The Farplane Cup Three duels in the Fiend Arena, and no rounds between them Three fighters wait in the arena, one after the other: a swordsman who walked a long road, a fast one whose name the arena keeps hidden, and a maester who feeds on black magic. The arena mends the girls between duels, and nothing else will. a stand-in stage the first duel count the turns OBJECTIVES Get past Auron Get past the hidden duelist Defeat Seymour TIP Each duel is a fresh fight. Shooting Star ejects a girl, the fast one opens with nine blows, and Seymour drinks fire, ice, thunder and water. START BATTLE Y Yuna LV 99 · 15 DRESSPHERES DARK KNIGHT R Rikku LV 99 · 15 DRESSPHERES ALCHEMIST P Paine LV 99 · 15 DRESSPHERES DARK KNIGHT",
